        <h1 class="headline-1 bhoig__headline glue-grid__col--span-8 glue-grid__col--span-7-md glue-grid__col--span-8-lg">StreetReaderAI: Towards making street view accessible via context-aware multimodal AI</h1>

        

          <div class="basic-hero__description bhoig__description glue-grid__col--span-8 glue-grid__col--span-7-md glue-grid__col--span-8-lg">
            <div class="basic-hero--blog-detail__description"><p>October 29, 2025</p><span class="dot-separator"></span><p>Jon E. Froehlich, Visiting Faculty Researcher, and Shaun Kane, Research Scientist, Google Research</p></div>
          </div>

        

        <div class="bhoig__cta glue-grid__col--span-8 glue-grid__col--span-7-md glue-grid__col--span-8-lg">
          
