          <p data-block-key="xrzw7"><i>StreetReaderAI uses</i> <a href="https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/live" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i>Gemini Live</i></a><i> to provide a real-time, interactive conversation about the scene and local geographic features. For the full audio-video experience, including sound, please refer to this</i> <a href="https://youtu.be/unsNaq-ea3s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i>YouTube video</i></a><i>.</i></p>
