        <div class="
          glue-grid__col
          glue-grid__col--span-4-sm
          glue-grid__col--span-12-md
          caption
          --center
        ">
          <p data-block-key="jvl9c"><i>In one study task, participants were given the instruction, “Find out about an unfamiliar playground to plan a trip with your two young nieces.” This video clip illustrates the diversity of questions asked and the responsiveness of StreetReaderAI. For the full audio-video experience, including sound, please refer to this</i> <a href="https://youtu.be/Uxj5fSCp1Dg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i>YouTube video</i></a><i>.</i></p>
